OL,3,GNEWSA'I am a survivor but I am also so
OL,4,Amany other things'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA survivor of sexual assault has
OL,7,Fdedicated herself to raising money for
OL,8,Fa charity which she said was a
OL,9,F"game-changer" when she was at her
OL,10,Flowest.
OL,12,FSaxon Rose was 13 when she told her
OL,13,Fparents that she had been sexually
OL,14,Fabused but she promised herself then
OL,15,Fthat she would never talk about it
OL,16,Fagain.
