OL,3,GNEWSA'I am a survivor but I am also so
OL,4,Amany other things'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow 30, Saxon said she finally felt
OL,7,Fempowered to speak out after she
OL,8,Freceived support from Gloucestershire
OL,9,FRape and Sexual Abuse Centre (GRASAC).
OL,10,FShe is raising money for the centre
OL,11,Fwhich is currently facing major
OL,12,Ffinancial challenges.
OL,14,F"I didn't do anything wrong [and] the
OL,15,Fshame is not mine," said Saxon. "I am a
OL,16,Fsurvivor but I am also so many other
OL,17,Fthings."
